  <name>OXPlayer</name>
  <summary>Telegram media library client</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      OXPlayer is a cross-platform client focused on your Telegram media library.
      Sign in with Telegram, browse catalogued media, and stream with a Flutter UI.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Telegram-first sign-in and library access</li>
      <li>Responsive layout for phone, tablet, and desktop</li>
      <li>Hardware-accelerated video playback</li>
      <li>Multiple profiles where supported</li>
      <li>Offline features on supported platforms</li>
      <li>Cross-platform builds</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  
